        "claim": "Nine out of ten young men in youth offending institutions had reportedly been excluded from school \u2014 though this figure comes from a single non-independent source and should be treated as indicative only.",
        "evidence_id": "E14",
        "quote": "nine out of ten young men in youth offending institutions had been excluded from school"
      },
